                     <h2 class="heading is_ is_bottom is_left">Using D2L Brightspace to Access Courses</h2>
                  </div>
                  
                  <p>Kennesaw State University's D2L Brightspace is a comprehensive Learning Management
                     System that supports the university's academic needs. This platform provides students,
                     faculty, and staff with convenient access to course materials, assignments, and updates.
                     Faculty and staff can find detailed guidance on managing courses, accessing technical
                     support, and integrating third-party tools. Students can access their current and
                     upcoming term courses, with additional resources available for eCore courses and course
                     date modifications.</p>
                  
                  <p>Stay informed on the latest D2L updates and system improvements through the regular
                     updates provided by the university!</p>
                  
